msgstr "``--at=RFC3339``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:603
msgid ""
"``schedule``: the UTC release instant for ``:publish-at:``; required."
msgstr ""
"``schedule``: der UTC-Freigabezeitpunkt für ``:publish-at:``; "
