#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:292
#| msgid ""
#| "A plugin ID is looked up among the plugins linked into the "
#| "``guidedog`` executable first, then among the programs registered with "
#| "``guidedog plugin register ID PATH``. A normal build invokes no "
#| "publisher. ``--untrusted`` disables build plugins. Build plugins "
#| "transform source text, post-process complete HTML pages, and add "
#| "generated assets. See :doc:`../plugins`."
msgid ""
"A plugin ID is looked up among the plugins linked into the ``guidedog`` "
"executable first, then among the programs registered with ``guidedog "
"plugin register ID PATH``. A normal build invokes no publisher. "
"``--untrusted`` disables build plugins (see `Trust`_). Build plugins "
"transform source text, post-process complete HTML pages, and add "
"generated assets. See :doc:`../plugins`."
msgstr "Eine Plugin-ID wird zuerst unter den in das Programm ``guidedog`` eingebundenen Plugins gesucht, dann unter den mit ``guidedog plugin register ID PATH`` registrierten Programmen. Ein normaler Build ruft keinen Publisher auf. ``--untrusted`` deaktiviert Build-Plugins (siehe `Trust`_). Build-Plugins verändern Quelltext, bearbeiten vollständige HTML-Seiten nach und ergänzen erzeugte Ressourcen. Siehe :doc:`../plugins`."

